### `@AI` Chat Integration ([ChatServiceImpl.java](file:///c:/final_year_project/scl-backend/src/main/java/com/scl/modules/chat/service/ChatServiceImpl.java))
- Detects messages starting with `@AI` (case-insensitive)
- Spawns a background thread → calls FastAPI `/ai/chat`
- Saves AI response to `chat_messages` table (sender = `ai.bot@scl.edu`)
- Broadcasts AI response over STOMP to `/topic/chat/{roomId}` so **all group members see it simultaneously**

