## How to Test

1. **Start the backend** — `cd scl-backend && mvn spring-boot:run`
2. **Start the AI service** — `cd scl-ai-service && uvicorn app.main:app --reload`
3. **Start the frontend** — `cd scl-frontend/scl && npm run dev`
4. Navigate to **`/collaboration`** → Create or join a study group
5. Open the group → navigate through **Chat / Resources / Announcements / Members** tabs
6. In Chat, type `@AI Explain Normalization` → watch AI respond to all group members live
7. Upload a PDF → wait for AI summary to appear on the resource card
8. As a Teacher, verify a resource and post an announcement

> [!TIP]
> The invite code is displayed in the group workspace header. Share it (or copy it) and use **Join via Code** from any other logged-in account to test multi-user group collaboration.
